<title>NORWAY: Norway awards Barents Sea oil exploration licences.</title>
<headline>Norway awards Barents Sea oil exploration licences.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway said on Thursday it had invited 10 companies to take part in oil exploration licences in seven areas of the Barents Sea region.</p>
<p>The companies included Norsk Hydro ASA, Elf Petroleum, Saga Petroleum, Agip, Mobil and Den norske stats oljeselskap (Statoil).  </p>
<p>The Oil and Energy Ministry said three of the licences were normal exploration/development awards, while four were for so-called seismic areas.</p>
<p>Although there had been several finds in the Barents Sea since exploration began in 1980, no economic discoveries have been made so far.</p>
<p>&quot;There is still reason to believe, however, that a considerable oil and gas resources are hidden in the Barents Sea,&quot; the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The future challenge will be to prove these resources so that exploration can secure further activities in the area, give future income and contribute to employment in the north.&quot;  </p>
<p>Following lists the groups offered licences under the so-called Barents Sea Project:</p>
<p>Licence A  (seismic)</p>
<p>    Operator: Norsk Hydro	   20 percent</p>
<p>		  Mobil		   15</p>
<p>		  Saga		    10</p>
<p>		  Elf		     10 State's direct financial</p>
<p>interest (SDFI) 30</p>
<p>Licence B</p>
<p>    Operator: Elf		     30 percent</p>
<p>		  Mobil		   25</p>
<p>		  Phillips	25</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    20</p>
<p>Licence C  (seismic)</p>
<p>    Operator: Saga		    20</p>
<p>		  Statoil		 20</p>
<p>		  Agip		    15</p>
<p>		  Enterprise  15</p>
<p>		  Neste     10</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    20</p>
<p>Licence D</p>
<p>    Operator: Saga		    30</p>
<p>		  Norsk Hydro	   20</p>
<p>		  Statoil		 20</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    30</p>
<p>Licence E</p>
<p>    Operator: Agip		    25</p>
<p>		  Phillips		25</p>
<p>		  Enterprise	    15</p>
<p>		  Neste		   15</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    20</p>
<p>Licence F  (seismic)</p>
<p>    Operator: Mobil		   20</p>
<p>		  Amerada Hess 15</p>
<p>		  Norsk Hydro	   15</p>
<p>		  Saga		    15</p>
<p>		  Statoil		 15</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    20</p>
<p>Licence G  (seismic)</p>
