<p>		  Saga		    20</p>
<p>		  Agip		    15</p>
<p>		  Norsk Hydro	   15</p>
<p>		  SDFI		    20</p>
<p>The ministry said companies were expected to respond to the offers in the week beginning May 26.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
